      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Peixe Aquático. Quagsire é um Pokémon despreocupado e de natureza tranquila. Enquanto nada, está sempre batendo no casco dos barcos. Por causa de sua atitude relaxada, também costuma acertar a cabeça nas rochas do fundo dos rios.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 6 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 5 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Água 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 2/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Quagsire é a evolução final de Wooper.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Mud Sport, Tail Whip, Water Gun</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Mud Shot</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Mud Bomb</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Amnesia</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Aqua Tail</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Earthquake</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Rain Dance</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Haze, Mist, Toxic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Muddy Water</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Acid Spray, After You, Amnesia, Aqua Tail, Attract, Avalanche, Blizzard, Body Press, Body Slam, Brick Break, Bulldoze, Chilling Water, Confide, Curse, Dig, Dive, Double Team, Double-Edge, Drain Punch, Earth Power, Earthquake, Eerie Impulse, Encore, Endure, Facade, Fling, Focus Blast, Focus Punch, Frustration, Giga Impact, Guard Swap, Hail, Haze, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, High Horsepower, Hydro Pump, Hyper Beam, Ice Beam, Ice Punch, Icy Wind, Infestation, Iron Tail, Liquidation, Mega Kick, Mega Punch, Mud Shot, Mud-Slap, Muddy Water, Protect, Rain Dance, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Sandstorm, Scald, Sleep Talk, Sludge Bomb, Sludge Wave, Snore, Snowscape, Spikes, Stealth Rock, Stomping Tantrum, Stone Edge, Substitute, Surf, Swagger, Take Down, Tera Blast, Thief, Toxic, Toxic Spikes, Trailblaze, Water Pulse, Waterfall, Whirlpool</p>",
